Package: opensr
Title: Open Science Orchestration for Systematic Reviews and Meta-Analysis
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: 
    person(given = "OpenSR", family = "Contributors", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "maintainers@example.org")
Description: A fully free and open-source orchestration and standards layer for
    open-science-aligned systematic review and meta-analysis workflows.
    The package standardizes project structure, metadata, provenance,
    screening logs, extraction templates, synthesis wrappers, PRISMA-ready
    reporting scaffolds, and OSF-friendly archive exports.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
